answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["q-343860/ma-source-field/48e5f4e5c20deb1c0085f9e9b9e3d8b6bda1fb4824b542398c2d9914e9647afe/bc9b8e56c324020c899cd1f7af2e425ca9189f38b3c31c4e3fae8b18a905005a" "q-343860/ma-source-field/48e5f4e5c20deb1c0085f9e9b9e3d8b6bda1fb4824b542398c2d9914e9647afe/9c22dc07514f6718020811243b3d14107b06c724128a566c2018b36bbc862231" "q-343860/ma-source-field/48e5f4e5c20deb1c0085f9e9b9e3d8b6bda1fb4824b542398c2d9914e9647afe/982430d146bce00d0355cbee56fa4fa5df8060c58c484447b760e2dc17fa08ef"] :answer-field/correct "q-343860/ma-source-field/48e5f4e5c20deb1c0085f9e9b9e3d8b6bda1fb4824b542398c2d9914e9647afe/982430d146bce00d0355cbee56fa4fa5df8060c58c484447b760e2dc17fa08ef" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343860/ma-source-field/7d6a1a21ee26e5391449b69b9d67dcc89fde562df5be0e7394c6efc78e4a7fb6/d3918f793e1256fa3f01a8add41736a84e4d34d1f1f36c271042b8ba43761939" :answer/id #uuid "15b8dddf-399a-5ce8-a3a7-717ad28083fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{90(-1)^{n}}{n\\pi ({n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343860/ma-source-field/7d6a1a21ee26e5391449b69b9d67dcc89fde562df5be0e7394c6efc78e4a7fb6/0b7288f820c7ebd30aeb5d48cc42bcd9aaf420ee4f6be07d8a99d8a7191fd15c" :answer/id #uuid "52840280-13ca-54da-b4d4-afd74b42c883" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{18(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}\\pi ({n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343860/ma-source-field/7d6a1a21ee26e5391449b69b9d67dcc89fde562df5be0e7394c6efc78e4a7fb6/5e514b70568e8311b52f9f7b1a2072b3cea6eddab989aab10d5aa931f04f31a3" :answer/id #uuid "7120f89a-088f-5258-8c2d-358cc96f6e1c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{90(-1)^{n}}{n\\pi ({n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225)}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343860/ma-source-field/7d6a1a21ee26e5391449b69b9d67dcc89fde562df5be0e7394c6efc78e4a7fb6" :answer-field/id #uuid "615c3feb-87ab-595d-bd3c-9d3dd60c0bff" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/choices ["q-343860/ma-source-field/7d6a1a21ee26e5391449b69b9d67dcc89fde562df5be0e7394c6efc78e4a7fb6/d3918f793e1256fa3f01a8add41736a84e4d34d1f1f36c271042b8ba43761939" "q-343860/ma-source-field/7d6a1a21ee26e5391449b69b9d67dcc89fde562df5be0e7394c6efc78e4a7fb6/0b7288f820c7ebd30aeb5d48cc42bcd9aaf420ee4f6be07d8a99d8a7191fd15c" "q-343860/ma-source-field/7d6a1a21ee26e5391449b69b9d67dcc89fde562df5be0e7394c6efc78e4a7fb6/5e514b70568e8311b52f9f7b1a2072b3cea6eddab989aab10d5aa931f04f31a3"] :answer-field/correct "q-343860/ma-source-field/7d6a1a21ee26e5391449b69b9d67dcc89fde562df5be0e7394c6efc78e4a7fb6/5e514b70568e8311b52f9f7b1a2072b3cea6eddab989aab10d5aa931f04f31a3" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343860" :question/id #uuid "b2c46dfd-7116-546d-b775-da0e3f310626" :question/math-academy-id "q-343860" :question/problem "Select the missing parts in a particular solution of the differential equation ${y}^{′}-5y=f(x),$ where the Fourier series of the $6$-periodic forcing function is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼-5+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{2(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\n$$\n\nThe Fourier series of a particular solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p}∼{{field-1}} & +{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,{{field-2}}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}) \\\\  & +{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,{{field-3}}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We assume that a solution of our equation has the following Fourier series:\n\n$$\n{y}_{p}∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the derivative:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p}^{′} & ∼\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})) \\\\  & ∼0+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\cdot (-\\frac{n\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}))+{b}_{n}\\cdot \\frac{n\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}) \\\\  & ∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }-\\frac{{a}_{n}n\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})+\\frac{{b}_{n}n\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the expressions for ${y}_{p}^{′}$ and ${y}_{p}$ into the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & ({\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }-\\frac{{a}_{n}n\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})+\\frac{{b}_{n}n\\pi }{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})) \\\\  & \\,-5(\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})) \\\\  & \\,\\,=-5+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{2(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nRearranging the terms, we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & -5\\cdot \\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }(\\frac{{b}_{n}n\\pi }{3}-5{a}_{n})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}) \\\\  & \\,\\,+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }(-\\frac{{a}_{n}n\\pi }{3}-5{b}_{n})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}) \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,=-5+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{2(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, equating the free terms and the coefficients next to sines and cosines, we obtain the following system:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}-5\\cdot \\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}=-5 \\\\ \\frac{{b}_{n}n\\pi }{3}-5{a}_{n}=0 \\\\ -\\frac{{a}_{n}n\\pi }{3}-5{b}_{n}=\\frac{2(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the first equation, ${a}_{0}=2,$ which means the constant term is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}=1.\n$$\n\nNext, from the second equation, ${b}_{n}=\\frac{15{a}_{n}}{n\\pi }.$ Substituting this into the third equation, gives\n\n$$\n-\\frac{{a}_{n}n\\pi }{3}-5(\\frac{15{a}_{n}}{n\\pi })=\\frac{2(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\,⇒\\,{a}_{n}=\\frac{6(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, for ${a}_{n}$ with $n\\ge 1,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{n} & =\\frac{15{a}_{n}}{n\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{n\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{6(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225} \\\\  & =\\frac{90(-1)^{n}}{n\\pi ({n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our particular solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p}∼1 & +{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,\\frac{6(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}) \\\\  & +{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,\\frac{90(-1)^{n}}{n\\pi ({n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}+225)}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{3}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-343860/ma-source-field/1a0104e977313a7f0d29475904b9018aba589464008f836629d0434943d087be" "q-343860/ma-source-field/48e5f4e5c20deb1c0085f9e9b9e3d8b6bda1fb4824b542398c2d9914e9647afe" "q-343860/ma-source-field/7d6a1a21ee26e5391449b69b9d67dcc89fde562df5be0e7394c6efc78e4a7fb6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4733fab7-18ca-5336-9aba-53212ddbf87b"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343860"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343891/ma-source-field/87ff251901824b571e74be979256f8762bf3f6034d13923953296424234dcad1/3c8a9a23aecb09df521e3b52e6d760c65735e1de8d88cfa6550de6cd09a255ae" :answer/id #uuid "1bc27d3d-2228-5745-9f75-6ad665b3203a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "n=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343891/ma-source-field/87ff251901824b571e74be979256f8762bf3f6034d13923953296424234dcad1/7ac56aea5a96727421baaac9ed3756be68edc3d274a739832f17f1a959d14e73" :answer/id #uuid "c26489de-65c7-593c-9bc1-121a32b98a82" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "n=2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343891/ma-source-field/87ff251901824b571e74be979256f8762bf3f6034d13923953296424234dcad1/b465ccd11064456d225372c58416e340ff25e478cae5b40aed62a8f7ce4be377" :answer/id #uui